  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Recovery Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investments support Laos&#x2019; economic recovery and address social impacts from the COVID-19 pandemic. Australia&apos;s interventions aim to help Laos strengthen financial and economic management in ways that build resilience. The investment also aims to address social inequalities exacerbated during the COVID-19 pandemic. Women, people with disabilities, and ethnic minorities are at increased risk of poverty due to the pandemic. Our interventions aim to address critical needs of survivors of gender-based violence in response to heightened risks under COVID-19 conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
